<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 24pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  p {
    font-size: 11pt;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .product-listing {
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
  .product-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .product-image {
    width: 150px;
    height: auto;
    margin-right: 30px;
  }
  .product-details {
    flex-grow: 1;
  }
  .product-details h3 {
    font-size: 12pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .product-details p {
    margin: 2px 0;
    font-size: 10pt;
  }
  .footer {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 50px;
    left: 60px;
    right: 60px;
    font-size: 10pt;
    color: #555;
  }
  .divider {
    border-top: 1px solid #000;
    margin: 30px 0;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <h1>Webcam System</h1>
  <p>The webcam system is used to show the laboratory operations on the large projector screen. The webcam is mounted on a boom and is connected to the computer by a USB-Over-CAT5 cable. The CAT5 cable, which is a regular network cable, can be 25 or 50 feet long. To display the webcam on the computer, we us a free program called Yawcam (yet Another Webcam) from <a href="http://www.yawcam.com">http://www.yawcam.com</a>. The total cost of the webcam system is about <span data-field="total_system_cost">{{ total_system_cost }}</span> plus tax and shipping.</p>

  <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px; margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <img src="placeholder_yawcam_interface_1.png" alt="Yawcam Interface 1" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <img src="placeholder_yawcam_interface_2.png" alt="Yawcam Interface 2" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">The main window of Yawcam program</p>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <img src="placeholder_webcam_device.png" alt="Webcam Device" style="width: 200px; height: auto;">
  </div>

  <div class="product-listing">
    <div class="product-item">
      <img src="placeholder_webcam_product_image.png" alt="Logitech HD Pro Webcam C920" class="product-image">
      <div class="product-details">
        <h3>Logitech HD Pro Webcam C920, 1080p Widescreen Video Calling and Recording</h3>
        <p>Vendor: <span data-field="vendor_1">{{ vendor_1 }}</span></p>
        <p>Catalog Number: <span data-field="catalog_number_1">{{ catalog_number_1 }}</span></p>
        <p>Price: <span data-field="price_1">{{ price_1 }}</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="product-listing">
    {% for item in accessory_items %}
    <div class="product-item">
      <img src="placeholder_accessory_image.png" alt="Accessory" class="product-image">
      <div class="product-details">
        <h3>{{ item.description }}</h3>
        <p>Vendor: <span data-field="accessory_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].vendor">{{ accessory_items[loop.index0].vendor }}</span></p>
        <p>Catalog Number: <span data-field="accessory_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].catalog_number">{{ accessory_items[loop.index0].catalog_number }}</span></p>
        <p>Price: <span data-field="accessory_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].price">{{ accessory_items[loop.index0].price }}</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    Webcam System &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Page 1
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="product-listing">
    {% for item in accessory_items %}
    <div class="product-item">
      <img src="placeholder_accessory_image.png" alt="Accessory" class="product-image">
      <div class="product-details">
